Z||000000||bcwawright||05-18-2001||01:35 PM||||What kind of tool is used to take upper plenum bolts off. Where can I get?<BR>I also need NEW bolts(chrome)..any help.<BR>Thanks<P>Bruce 88GT Turbo Spyder F355 ||||reg||5
Z||000001||Mr.Frosty||05-18-2001||01:39 PM||||I used a metric socket,a 16 point I think "small".I can't remember the size.It was an uncommon size though.<P>------------------<BR>88 Formula T-top-Sold <BR>85 GT Turbo-project car||||reg||1
Z||000002||btoth||05-18-2001||02:47 PM||||12-point 10mm socket for all but one which is an 8mm.  and you need an allen wrench to remove the throttle body from the plenum, too.  and on mine, it took a 10mm wrench to remove the EGR tube down by the exhaust.<p>[This message has been edited by btoth (edited 05-18-2001).]||||reg||1
